# ------------------------------------------------------------
# P10 K-tiling representative regression
#
# These are directed single-case items.  They keep the default
# stress pools unchanged and force one lightweight CASE_ID=195 job
# per frontend path.
#
# CASE_ID=195: M=4, N=4, K=16, two K=8 tiles.
